{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0212","paragraphs":[{"id":"p3c6502ad80ee-1","text":"郁孤台下清江水。"},{"id":"p3f19804c550a-1","text":"中间多少行人泪。"},{"id":"p5833c61708a9-1","text":"西北是长安。"},{"id":"p2e8e5b38252f-1","text":"可怜无数山。"},{"id":"p912e86a8192e-1","text":"青山遮不住。"},{"id":"p3872079d35bd-1","text":"毕竟江流去。"},{"id":"p7711c861b47a-1","text":"江晚正愁予。"},{"id":"p96518a08ba36-1","text":"山深闻鹧鸪。"}]}